{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-switch-panel-logic-2-a-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-1","surface":"panel","area":"panel/logic-2","refs":["F-panel-721","F-panel-705","F-panel-730"],"severity":"S3","title":"Selling a personal training pack with a trainer named on it does not give that trainer the member","what":"A personal training plan carries a trainer's name, typed by hand in Plans. When the desk sells that pack, the name only shows on the plan line ('Trainer Rohit'). The member is not given to that trainer, so the trainer does not see the member in My members, cannot see their training progress, and is not the one the member's questions go to, until someone separately picks the trainer on the member's page. The typed name is also not tied to the gym's real trainers, so a spelling can match nobody.","expected":"The trainer on a training plan is picked from the gym's ticked trainers, and selling the pack gives the member to that trainer (or asks the desk to, in one tap).","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/Plans.tsx:274-277","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/Plans.tsx:397-399","apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/pt.ts:166-172","apps/dashboard/src/crm/shop/trainerApi.ts:87","apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/staffJobs.ts:34"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"pt-trainer-name-not-linked","who":"gyms that sell personal training, and their trainers","how_often":"every training pack sold with a trainer named","fix_line":"Pick the pack's trainer from the gym's trainers and give the member to them on sale","fix_size":"medium","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
